    ``access_token`` field is missing or empty. Distinct from
    :class:`OAuth2ServerException` (which represents non-2xx responses) so
    callers can recover differently.

    A sibling of :class:`ApiException` under the branded
    :class:`{{errorPrefix}}Exception` root -- it is an OAuth2 token-acquisition
    failure rather than an HTTP-status error, so it does not extend
    ``ApiException``. Callers can still catch every SDK error with one
    ``except {{errorPrefix}}Exception``."""
